{:edb/committed true :edb/basis-t 2624 :edb/replayed false :edb/tx-hash "f2c4e4843d7883e99c432df912c15b426c13be5defc9eb9001215086285db545" :edb/db-before-t 2623 :edb/db-after-t 2624 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535936 50 #inst "2026-10-15T09:28:17.973Z" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186119888 1038 #edb/ref 17592186544996 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186119888 1038 #edb/ref 17592186545007 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186119888 1040 #edb/ref 17592186545010 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544996 1068 #edb/ref 17592186545000 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544996 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544996 1071 "Find the surface area of the parametric surface defined by the equations \n\n$$\nx=2u-v,\\,y=3u+2,\\,z=u+2v\n$$\n\nfor $0\\le u\\le 5$ and $-1\\le v\\le 1.$" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544996 1072 #uuid "0f95e766-a2a3-5446-8a69-b8c1d5e53063" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544996 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface area of $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nIn vector form, our surface has the equation \n\n$$\nr(u,v)=⟨2u-v,\\,3u+2,\\,u+2v⟩.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(2u-v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3u+2),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(u+2v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨2,\\,3,\\,1⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(2u-v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3u+2),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(u+2v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,0,\\,2⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ 2 & 3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}2 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 2\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}2 & 3 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨6,\\,-5,\\,3⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨6,\\,-5,\\,3⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{6}^{2}+(-5)^{2}+{3}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{36+25+9} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{70}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, let's denote\n\n$$\nD={(u,v)\\,:\\,0\\le u\\le 5,\\,-1\\le v\\le 1}.\n$$\n\nThen, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{70}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{70}{∬}_{D}\\text{ }\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{70}\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{70}\\cdot 5\\cdot 2 \\\\  & =10 \\sqrt{70}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544997 1080 "5 \\sqrt{38} \\pi" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544997 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544997 1083 #uuid "362d1394-b2a3-59f8-a7c6-b46fc08ba352" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544998 1080 "5 \\sqrt{30}" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544998 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544998 1083 #uuid "48231604-0e12-5a6d-a30d-1c9f42fc155f" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544999 1080 "100" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544999 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186544999 1083 #uuid "52b8d8e7-0592-5b58-8e87-3aef78c72a94" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544998 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544999 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186545001 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186545005 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1075 #edb/ref 17592186545006 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1077 "selection" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1078 #edb/ref 17592186545006 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545000 1079 #uuid "598cd05f-a758-55c1-9174-123016a1cdf8" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545001 1080 "5 \\sqrt{35}" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545001 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545001 1083 #uuid "693f9a8b-9776-594c-ab46-cfd34df427e3" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545002 1080 "10 \\sqrt{57} \\pi" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545002 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545002 1083 #uuid "7c8f8746-3757-5c4f-81cf-138acecbfbba" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545003 1080 "10 \\sqrt{38} \\pi" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545003 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545003 1083 #uuid "8934de87-c2a8-50dc-a859-18d9952684f6" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545004 1080 "20 \\sqrt{19} \\pi" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545004 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545004 1083 #uuid "8a470d9a-3f5a-5616-9e52-a8ba1ef520a1" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545005 1080 "50" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545005 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545005 1083 #uuid "aa3c8f9f-076f-5a93-a3e7-2bef1961bd4b" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545006 1080 "10 \\sqrt{70}" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545006 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545006 1083 #uuid "af165af8-ee5a-57c7-a376-9cddd1c42513" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545007 1068 #edb/ref 17592186545009 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545007 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545007 1071 "Find the surface area of the part of the parametric surface $r(u,v)=⟨-u+v,\\,u-2v,\\,3v⟩$ that is subject to the constraint ${u}^{2}+{v}^{2}\\le 20.$" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545007 1072 #uuid "e42dd0ba-94bb-571f-b81d-083720a4e84b" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545007 1074 "For a surface $S$ with parametrization $r(u,v)$ for $(u,v)\\in D,$ the surface area of $S$ is given by\n\n$$\n{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nWe first compute the tangent vectors to the grid curves:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂u},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂u}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂u}(-u+v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(u-2v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂u}(3v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-1,\\,1,\\,0⟩ \\\\ {r}_{v}^{′} & =⟨\\frac{∂x}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂y}{∂v},\\,\\frac{∂z}{∂v}⟩ \\\\  & =⟨\\frac{∂}{∂v}(-u+v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(u-2v),\\,\\frac{∂}{∂v}(3v)⟩ \\\\  & =⟨1,\\,-2,\\,3⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the fundamental vector product is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′} & =|\\begin{aligned}i & j & k \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & -2 & 3\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =⟨|\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ -2 & 3\\end{aligned}|,\\,-|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|,\\,|\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & -2\\end{aligned}|⟩ \\\\  & =⟨3,\\,3,\\,1⟩,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nand \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖ & =‖⟨3,\\,3,\\,1⟩‖ \\\\  & =\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+{3}^{2}+{1}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{9+9+1} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{19}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, notice that the region ${u}^{2}+{v}^{2}\\le 20$ corresponds to the disk\n\n$$\nD={(u,v)\\,:\\,{u}^{2}+{v}^{2}\\le 20},\n$$\n\nof radius $2 \\sqrt{5}.$\n\nTherefore, the surface area is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}‖{r}_{u}^{′}\\times {r}_{v}^{′}‖\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\sqrt{19}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{19}{∬}_{D}\\text{d}A \\\\  & =\\sqrt{19}\\cdot \\text{Area}(D) \\\\  & =\\sqrt{19}\\cdot (\\pi \\cdot (2 \\sqrt{5})^{2}) \\\\  & =20 \\sqrt{19} \\pi.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545008 1080 "5 \\sqrt{19} \\pi" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545008 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545008 1083 #uuid "f066d9dd-0037-5da1-9b02-de938feb9f43" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186544997 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186545002 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186545003 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186545004 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1075 #edb/ref 17592186545008 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1077 "selection" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1078 #edb/ref 17592186545004 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545009 1079 #uuid "f72f9232-4b2e-53c4-9085-4f50862a7a79" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545010 1168 "generate/scratch/17592186119888.py" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true] [17592186545010 1169 #uuid "92f3e1ca-f67b-5933-9d82-67166ccbf4d0" 13194139535936 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {"0f95e766-a2a3-5446-8a69-b8c1d5e53063" 17592186544996 "362d1394-b2a3-59f8-a7c6-b46fc08ba352" 17592186544997 "48231604-0e12-5a6d-a30d-1c9f42fc155f" 17592186544998 "52b8d8e7-0592-5b58-8e87-3aef78c72a94" 17592186544999 "598cd05f-a758-55c1-9174-123016a1cdf8" 17592186545000 "693f9a8b-9776-594c-ab46-cfd34df427e3" 17592186545001 "7c8f8746-3757-5c4f-81cf-138acecbfbba" 17592186545002 "8934de87-c2a8-50dc-a859-18d9952684f6" 17592186545003 "8a470d9a-3f5a-5616-9e52-a8ba1ef520a1" 17592186545004 "aa3c8f9f-076f-5a93-a3e7-2bef1961bd4b" 17592186545005 "af165af8-ee5a-57c7-a376-9cddd1c42513" 17592186545006 "e42dd0ba-94bb-571f-b81d-083720a4e84b" 17592186545007 "f066d9dd-0037-5da1-9b02-de938feb9f43" 17592186545008 "f72f9232-4b2e-53c4-9085-4f